1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,080
Video ya leo ni nini? Ni kuhusu sababu za kuzungumza.

2
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:09,580
Mstari 1: Mazungumzo Kabla ya Mvua

3
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:13,220
Eeh, anga limeziba.

4
00:00:13,243 --> 00:00:15,221
Ndiyo, kweli.

5
00:00:15,244 --> 00:00:18,644
Kuna mawingu meusi mengi.

6
00:00:18,667 --> 00:00:21,236
Mvua itanyesha, sio?

7
00:00:21,259 --> 00:00:22,625
Ndiyo.

8
00:00:22,648 --> 00:00:25,015
Una mwavuli?

9
00:00:25,038 --> 00:00:27,723
Hapana, sina.

10
00:00:27,747 --> 00:00:31,113
Basi, njoo chini ya mwavuli wangu.

11
00:00:31,136 --> 00:00:33,221
Asante.

12
00:00:33,244 --> 00:00:37,878
Nina mwavuli mkubwa, basi hakuna matata.

13
00:00:37,902 --> 00:00:39,950
Wewe ni mpole sana.

14
00:00:39,973 --> 00:00:42,866
Hapana, si kitu.

15
00:00:42,889 --> 00:00:46,622
Eeh, upepo pia umeongezeka.

16
00:00:46,645 --> 00:00:48,887
Ndiyo, kweli.

17
00:00:48,911 --> 00:00:51,247
Baridi sana.

18
00:00:51,270 --> 00:00:53,046
Haraka kidogo.

19
00:00:53,070 --> 00:00:55,727
Ndiyo, fanya hivyo.

20
00:00:55,750 --> 00:00:58,022
Tukimbie hadi kituo?

21
00:00:58,046 --> 00:01:01,324
Ni hatari, basi twende kwa miguu.

22
00:01:01,347 --> 00:01:03,080
Sawa.

23
00:01:03,103 --> 00:01:06,636
Eeh, mvua imenyesa.

24
00:01:06,659 --> 00:01:09,326
Fungua mwavuli upesi.

25
00:01:09,349 --> 00:01:11,082
Tafadhali.

26
00:01:11,105 --> 00:01:13,706
Mizigo yako iko salama?

27
00:01:13,730 --> 00:01:18,063
Mfuko wangu unaweza kufura, basi nitamkinga mbele.

28
00:01:18,086 --> 00:01:20,130
Nitaishika mimi.

29
00:01:20,154 --> 00:01:22,087
Haina matata.

30
00:01:22,110 --> 00:01:24,077
Sawa.

31
00:01:24,100 --> 00:01:27,834
Eeh, nasikia sauti ya radi.

32
00:01:27,857 --> 00:01:29,823
Inaogopesha, sio?

33
00:01:29,846 --> 00:01:33,302
Tuingie katika mgahawa wa karibu?

34
00:01:33,326 --> 00:01:34,959
Sawa sana.

35
00:01:34,982 --> 00:01:38,982
Mvua imekuwa kubwa, basi twishe kidogo.

36
00:01:39,005 --> 00:01:42,606
Kwenye pembe hiyo kuna mgahawa mpya.

37
00:01:42,629 --> 00:01:44,363
Ule pale, sio?

38
00:01:44,386 --> 00:01:46,596
Ndiyo, twende.

39
00:01:46,619 --> 00:01:55,628
Skripu ya video ya leo inaweza kupakuliwa kutoka kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu. Tafadhali achia maoni kabla ya kupakua.

40
00:01:55,628 --> 00:01:57,128
Mstari 2: Chagua Nguo na Bei

41
00:01:57,128 --> 00:02:00,168
Hii nguo inakuwaje?

42
00:02:00,192 --> 00:02:02,458
Sawa sana.

43
00:02:02,481 --> 00:02:06,966
Kuna shati nyekundu na shati ya buluu.

44
00:02:06,990 --> 00:02:09,590
Unapenda ipi?

45
00:02:09,613 --> 00:02:13,979
Napenda shati nyekundu.

46
00:02:14,002 --> 00:02:16,569
Inakufaa sana.

47
00:02:16,592 --> 00:02:18,662
Asante.

48
00:02:18,686 --> 00:02:21,019
Utaiznunua?

49
00:02:21,042 --> 00:02:25,775
Ni ghali kidogo, basi nina wasiwasi.

50
00:02:25,798 --> 00:02:27,599
Bei gani?

51
00:02:27,622 --> 00:02:30,092
Elfu tano za Kijapani.

52
00:02:30,116 --> 00:02:33,082
Ni ghali kidogo, sio?

53
00:02:33,105 --> 00:02:37,379
Shati la buluu ni shilingi elfu tatu.

54
00:02:37,403 --> 00:02:39,271
Bei rahisi sana!

55
00:02:39,295 --> 00:02:40,928
Ndiyo.

56
00:02:40,951 --> 00:02:45,320
Lakini shati la nyekundu linaonekana vizuri zaidi.

57
00:02:45,344 --> 00:02:48,177
Nadhani hivyo pia.

58
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:51,835
Basi, tutchukue shati la nyekundu.

59
00:02:51,858 --> 00:02:56,346
Lakini sina pesa, kwa hiyo siwezi kununua.

60
00:02:56,370 --> 00:02:58,403
Nikukopeshe?

61
00:02:58,426 --> 00:03:01,159
Eh, ni sawa hiyo?

62
00:03:01,182 --> 00:03:04,618
Ndiyo, hakuna matata.

63
00:03:04,642 --> 00:03:06,409
Pole.

64
00:03:06,432 --> 00:03:08,665
Usijali.

65
00:03:08,688 --> 00:03:12,359
Mwezi ujao nitakuruhusu bila shaka.

66
00:03:12,383 --> 00:03:14,949
Usiwe na haraka, polepole ndio bora.

67
00:03:14,972 --> 00:03:16,739
Asante.

68
00:03:16,762 --> 00:03:20,377
Unataka chochote kingine?

69
00:03:20,401 --> 00:03:25,620
Viatu vyangu vimekuwa vimechakaa, nataka viatu vipya.

70
00:03:25,644 --> 00:03:27,977
Tutazame duka la viatu pia?

71
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:30,733
Ndiyo, nataka kwenda.

72
00:03:30,756 --> 00:03:34,489
Kuna duka kubwa la viatu pale.

73
00:03:34,512 --> 00:03:36,389
Twende.

74
00:03:36,413 --> 00:03:43,518
Kiungo cha tovuti ambapo unaweza kukagua video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu. *Tovuti inaweza kufutwa bila tahadhari.

75
00:03:43,518 --> 00:03:45,018
Sehemu ya 3: Mwaliko wa Filamu na Kukataa / Mwaliko wa Kuangalia Filamu na Kukataa

76
00:03:45,018 --> 00:03:48,452
Je, una muda wa ziada Jumamosi ijayo?

77
00:03:48,475 --> 00:03:50,678
Jumamosi?

78
00:03:50,702 --> 00:03:52,271
Ndiyo.

79
00:03:52,294 --> 00:03:54,311
Una mpango wowote?

80
00:03:54,334 --> 00:03:58,192
Nimepata tiketi mbili za sinema.

81
00:03:58,216 --> 00:04:00,185
Sinema?

82
00:04:00,208 --> 00:04:02,042
Ndiyo.

83
00:04:02,066 --> 00:04:05,236
Ni filamu mpya ya hatua.

84
00:04:05,260 --> 00:04:07,066
Sawa sana.

85
00:04:07,089 --> 00:04:10,531
Je, tutaangalia pamoja?

86
00:04:10,554 --> 00:04:15,554
Ningependa kwenda, lakini Jumamosi ni ngumu kidogo.

87
00:04:15,577 --> 00:04:17,511
Sawa.

88
00:04:17,534 --> 00:04:21,348
Nina kazi ya muda, kwa hiyo siwezi kwenda.

89
00:04:21,371 --> 00:04:23,971
Unafanya kazi hadi saa ngapi?

90
00:04:23,994 --> 00:04:26,927
Hadi saa mbili usiku.

91
00:04:26,950 --> 00:04:29,529
Hiyo ni ya kusikitisha.

92
00:04:29,552 --> 00:04:32,288
Samahani sana.

93
00:04:32,312 --> 00:04:35,045
Jumapili je?

94
00:04:35,068 --> 00:04:38,201
Jumapili niko huru.

95
00:04:38,224 --> 00:04:41,500
Basi, tutaangalia Jumapili.

96
00:04:41,524 --> 00:04:45,207
Tiketi ni za Jumamosi?

97
00:04:45,231 --> 00:04:49,270
Hapana, unaweza kuangalia wakati wowote.

98
00:04:49,294 --> 00:04:51,494
Sawa.

99
00:04:51,517 --> 00:04:54,950
Saa saba mchana Jumapili je?

100
00:04:54,973 --> 00:04:57,976
Saa hiyo ni sawa.

101
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:00,633
Sawa sana.

102
00:05:00,656 --> 00:05:03,099
Nangojea kwa hamu.

103
00:05:03,122 --> 00:05:06,764
Baada ya filamu, tutakula chakula?

104
00:05:06,788 --> 00:05:08,755
Sawa sana.

105
00:05:08,778 --> 00:05:14,421
Najua mgahawa mzuri wa Kiitaliano, tutakwenda huko.

106
00:05:14,444 --> 00:05:16,778
Ninashukuru sana.

107
00:05:16,801 --> 00:05:21,810
Basi, tutaonana saa sita na nusu mchana Jumapili kwenye stesheni.

108
00:05:21,833 --> 00:05:23,800
Sawa.

109
00:05:23,823 --> 00:05:26,429
Usichelewe, tafadhali.

110
00:05:26,452 --> 00:05:28,385
Haina matata.

111
00:05:28,408 --> 00:05:29,908
Sehemu ya 4: Sababu za Kuchelewa na Kuomba Radhi / Sababu za Kuchelewa na Kuomba Radhi

112
00:05:29,908 --> 00:05:32,342
Umechelewa sana!

113
00:05:32,365 --> 00:05:35,765
Samahani, nimechelewa.

114
00:05:35,788 --> 00:05:38,086
Umekuwaje?

115
00:05:38,109 --> 00:05:43,743
Barabara zilikuwa zina msongamano mkubwa, basi haikuhamia.

116
00:05:43,767 --> 00:05:45,767
Ajali?

117
00:05:45,790 --> 00:05:49,723
Ndiyo, kulikuwa na ajali kubwa.

118
00:05:49,746 --> 00:05:52,679
Hiyo ilikuwa mbaya sana.

119
00:05:52,702 --> 00:05:55,472
Samahani sana.

120
00:05:55,495 --> 00:05:58,529
Nimekuwa nikingoja kwa muda mrefu.

121
00:05:58,552 --> 00:06:00,752
Ulikuwa na baridi?

122
00:06:00,775 --> 00:06:03,872
Ndiyo, kidogo ilikuwa baridi.

123
00:06:03,895 --> 00:06:07,062
Tununue kinywaji cha moto.

124
00:06:07,085 --> 00:06:08,852
Asante.

125
00:06:08,875 --> 00:06:11,041
Kahawa inatosha?

126
00:06:11,064 --> 00:06:15,997
Mimi napenda chai, basi chai tafadhali.

127
00:06:16,020 --> 00:06:17,867
Sawa.

128
00:06:17,891 --> 00:06:21,299
Kuna mashine ya kununulia huko.

129
00:06:21,323 --> 00:06:23,222
Nitainunua.

130
00:06:23,245 --> 00:06:25,492
Ningojea.

131
00:06:25,516 --> 00:06:27,982
Haya, chai yako.

132
00:06:28,005 --> 00:06:29,772
Asante.

133
00:06:29,795 --> 00:06:32,852
Filamu itaanza saa ngapi?

134
00:06:32,875 --> 00:06:37,327
Tuna dakika thelathini bado, basi tutafika kwa wakati.

135
00:06:37,351 --> 00:06:39,524
Tutafika kwa wakati.

136
00:06:39,548 --> 00:06:42,127
Ndiyo, nimefurahi.

137
00:06:42,150 --> 00:06:45,550
Mara inayofuata nitakuwa makini.

138
00:06:45,573 --> 00:06:48,573
Ondoka nyumbani mapema kidogo.

139
00:06:48,596 --> 00:06:50,366
Nitakufanya hivyo.

140
00:06:50,389 --> 00:06:53,756
Sasa twende sinema.

141
00:06:53,779 --> 00:06:56,517
Ndiyo, twende.

142
00:06:56,540 --> 00:06:59,073
Una tiketi?

143
00:06:59,096 --> 00:07:02,363
Ndiyo, iko ndani ya mfuko wangu.

144
00:07:02,386 --> 00:07:04,794
Sawa sana.

145
00:07:04,818 --> 00:07:06,318
Sehemu ya 5: Taarifa ya Ugonjwa

146
00:07:06,318 --> 00:07:09,328
Halo, habari za asubuhi.

147
00:07:09,351 --> 00:07:11,641
Habari za asubuhi.

148
00:07:11,665 --> 00:07:13,515
Pole.

149
00:07:13,538 --> 00:07:16,829
Leo sitahudhuria shule.

150
00:07:16,853 --> 00:07:18,819
Umekuwaje?

151
00:07:18,842 --> 00:07:24,642
Tangu asubuhi naumwa kichwa sana, sipati kusimama.

152
00:07:24,665 --> 00:07:27,147
Una homa?

153
00:07:27,171 --> 00:07:30,405
Ndiyo, na homa ya digrii thelathini na nane.

154
00:07:30,428 --> 00:07:33,312
Hiyo ni homa kubwa.

155
00:07:33,335 --> 00:07:35,946
Koo pia linaniuma.

156
00:07:35,970 --> 00:07:38,261
Utakwenda hospitali?

157
00:07:38,284 --> 00:07:41,818
Ndiyo, nitakwenda hospitali baada ya mchana.

158
00:07:41,841 --> 00:07:45,641
Labda ni homa ya mafua.

159
00:07:45,664 --> 00:07:47,430
Sijui.

160
00:07:47,453 --> 00:07:49,908
Umekwisha kunywa dawa?

161
00:07:49,931 --> 00:07:55,627
Bado sijawa hospitalini, basi sina dawa ya hospitali.

162
00:07:55,651 --> 00:07:57,784
Sawa.

163
00:07:57,807 --> 00:08:00,505
Nimenywa dawa ya nyumbani.

164
00:08:00,529 --> 00:08:03,699
Ni vyema kulala kidogo.

165
00:08:03,722 --> 00:08:06,156
Ndiyo, nitakufanya hivyo.

166
00:08:06,179 --> 00:08:09,179
Mtihani wa leo utakuwaje?

167
00:08:09,202 --> 00:08:11,735
Nitapiga simu kwa mwalimu.

168
00:08:11,758 --> 00:08:15,034
Je, nikumwambie mwalimu?

169
00:08:15,058 --> 00:08:16,698
Tafadhali.

170
00:08:16,721 --> 00:08:19,209
Sio lazima.

171
00:08:19,233 --> 00:08:21,234
Asante.

172
00:08:21,257 --> 00:08:23,824
Pumzika polepole.

173
00:08:23,847 --> 00:08:26,783
Labda nitapumzika kesho pia.

174
00:08:26,806 --> 00:08:29,865
Usijitwike tafadhali.

175
00:08:29,888 --> 00:08:31,778
Wewe ni mpole sana.

176
00:08:31,802 --> 00:08:34,881
Upate nafuu haraka.

177
00:08:34,904 --> 00:08:37,159
Ndiyo, asante.

178
00:08:37,183 --> 00:08:40,023
Tutaonana kesho.

179
00:08:40,046 --> 00:08:42,129
Nitakuaga.

180
00:08:42,153 --> 00:08:43,653
Mandhari ya 6: Chaguo la Usafiri wa Kufikia Haraka ili Kupata Wakati / Chaguzi za Usafiri wa Haraka Wakati wa Kukosa Wakati

181
00:08:43,653 --> 00:08:46,304
Saa mbili zimepita sasa.

182
00:08:46,328 --> 00:08:49,261
Ndiyo, harakisha.

183
00:08:49,284 --> 00:08:52,418
Utaenda ofisini kwa nini?

184
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:55,207
Kwa kawaida naenda kwa treni.

185
00:08:55,230 --> 00:08:58,499
Tutakwenda kwenye stesheni kwa miguu sasa?

186
00:08:58,523 --> 00:09:02,990
Stesheni iko mbali, itachukua muda.

187
00:09:03,013 --> 00:09:05,222
Je, basi ni nini?

188
00:09:05,246 --> 00:09:08,379
Basi pia itachukua muda.

189
00:09:08,402 --> 00:09:12,675
Hatuna wakati, basi twende kwa teksi.

190
00:09:12,699 --> 00:09:14,266
Ndiyo, kweli.

191
00:09:14,289 --> 00:09:16,922
Je, nitawaita teksi?

192
00:09:16,945 --> 00:09:19,552
Kuna teksi pale.

193
00:09:19,576 --> 00:09:21,448
Tuinue mikono.

194
00:09:21,471 --> 00:09:23,838
Imekaa.

195
00:09:23,861 --> 00:09:25,327
Twende ndani.

196
00:09:25,350 --> 00:09:28,384
Aa, mlango umefunguka.

197
00:09:28,407 --> 00:09:30,540
Tafadhali nendeni ofisini.

198
00:09:30,563 --> 00:09:32,649
Je, tutafika kwa wakati?

199
00:09:32,672 --> 00:09:36,246
Barabara ziko wazi, tutafika salama.

200
00:09:36,270 --> 00:09:38,003
Sawa sana.

201
00:09:38,026 --> 00:09:41,193
Kwa kawaida unasogea nyumbani saa ngapi?

202
00:09:41,216 --> 00:09:43,226
Naondoka saa moja.

203
00:09:43,249 --> 00:09:45,783
Leo uliamka usingizi?

204
00:09:45,806 --> 00:09:47,289
Ndiyo.

205
00:09:47,312 --> 00:09:50,512
Jana nililala sana.

206
00:09:50,535 --> 00:09:52,869
Ulikuwa unafanya nini?

207
00:09:52,892 --> 00:09:55,309
Nilikuwa ninapiga filamu.

208
00:09:55,333 --> 00:09:57,425
Ilikuwa nzuri?

209
00:09:57,448 --> 00:10:02,332
Ilikuwa nzuri sana, ndiyo niliona hadi mwisho.

210
00:10:02,356 --> 00:10:04,646
Leo kulala mapema.

211
00:10:04,670 --> 00:10:07,036
Ndiyo, nitakufanya hivyo.

212
00:10:07,059 --> 00:10:10,326
Aa, tuko karibu kufika ofisini.

213
00:10:10,349 --> 00:10:12,435
Haraka sana.

214
00:10:12,459 --> 00:10:15,145
Teksi ni rahisi.

215
00:10:15,168 --> 00:10:16,668
Mandhari ya 7: Chaguo la Karai na Matembezi ya Kula Karai / Chaguzi na Matembezi ya Kula Karai

216
00:10:16,668 --> 00:10:19,739
Nina njaa.

217
00:10:19,763 --> 00:10:22,897
Ndiyo, tuje tukale kitu.

218
00:10:22,920 --> 00:10:25,287
Unataka kula nini?

219
00:10:25,310 --> 00:10:28,944
Nataka karai.

220
00:10:28,967 --> 00:10:32,033
Karai? Nzuri.

221
00:10:32,056 --> 00:10:36,456
Napenda vitu vikali, kwa hiyo naikula mara kwa mara.

222
00:10:36,479 --> 00:10:39,285
Tutakwenda dukani gani?

223
00:10:39,309 --> 00:10:44,042
Kuna duka jipya la vyakula vya Kihindi mbele ya stesheni.

224
00:10:44,065 --> 00:10:47,798
Karai ya duka hilo ni nzuri?

225
00:10:47,821 --> 00:10:51,036
Rafiki alisema ni nzuri.

226
00:10:51,060 --> 00:10:53,027
Twende tujaribu.

227
00:10:53,050 --> 00:10:55,816
Tutakwenda kwa miguu?

228
00:10:55,839 --> 00:10:58,573
Ni karibu, twende kwa miguu.

229
00:10:58,596 --> 00:11:01,996
Kuna chaguo nyingi kwenye menyu, sivyo?

230
00:11:02,019 --> 00:11:05,152
Nitachukua karai ya kuku.

231
00:11:05,175 --> 00:11:08,822
Mimi nitachukua karai ya mboga.

232
00:11:08,845 --> 00:11:11,618
Kwa vinywaji, utachukua nini?

233
00:11:11,642 --> 00:11:15,893
Ina pilipili sana, naomba maji baridi.

234
00:11:15,916 --> 00:11:19,650
Mimi nitakunywa juisi tamu.

235
00:11:19,673 --> 00:11:25,206
Kwa habari za rafiki, nan hii hapa ni tamu sana!

236
00:11:25,229 --> 00:11:28,429
Basi, na tuagize nan pia.

237
00:11:28,452 --> 00:11:31,319
Je, utakula wali pia?

238
00:11:31,343 --> 00:11:36,110
Nina njaa sana, nitakula wali pia.

239
00:11:36,133 --> 00:11:38,333
Mnasikia chakula nyingi, sivyo?

240
00:11:38,356 --> 00:11:41,956
Ndiyo, napenda kula sana.

241
00:11:41,979 --> 00:11:44,579
Mimi pia sawa.

242
00:11:44,602 --> 00:11:46,970
Chakula kimefika!

243
00:11:46,993 --> 00:11:48,770
Tutakula sasa.

244
00:11:48,793 --> 00:11:51,467
Hii ni tamu sana!

245
00:11:51,491 --> 00:11:54,624
Ndiyo, na turudi tena.

246
00:11:54,647 --> 00:11:58,344
Mara inayofuata, nataka kujaribu karai tofauti.

247
00:11:58,368 --> 00:12:00,376
Ndiyo, kweli.

248
00:12:00,400 --> 00:12:01,900
Sehemu ya 8: Mchezo wa Tenisi mwishoni mwa wiki / Ratiba ya Tenisi ya Wikiendi

249
00:12:01,900 --> 00:12:05,666
Mwishoni mwa wiki unafanya nini?

250
00:12:05,689 --> 00:12:07,823
Nacheza tenisi.

251
00:12:07,845 --> 00:12:10,891
Unacheza tenisi kila wiki?

252
00:12:10,914 --> 00:12:15,085
Ndiyo, nacheza kila Jumapili.

253
00:12:15,109 --> 00:12:17,392
Unapenda tenisi?

254
00:12:17,416 --> 00:12:21,582
Ni ya kupendeza sana, napenda mno.

255
00:12:21,605 --> 00:12:24,296
Unacheza tenisi wapi?

256
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:27,853
Kuna uwanja wa tenisi kwenye bustani karibu.

257
00:12:27,876 --> 00:12:30,409
Unacheza na nani?

258
00:12:30,432 --> 00:12:32,968
Nacheza na rafiki zangu.

259
00:12:32,991 --> 00:12:35,325
Sawa sana.

260
00:12:35,348 --> 00:12:39,791
Kwa kuwa michezo inapunguza mfadhaiko, ni nzuri.

261
00:12:39,814 --> 00:12:43,581
Mimi pia nataka kufanya michezo fulani.

262
00:12:43,604 --> 00:12:47,137
Una michezo unayopenda?

263
00:12:47,160 --> 00:12:50,727
Napenda kuogelea.

264
00:12:50,750 --> 00:12:53,716
Je, bwawa linakufaa?

265
00:12:53,739 --> 00:12:58,237
Sasa ni majira ya baridi, maji ni baridi sana.

266
00:12:58,261 --> 00:13:01,027
Kuna bwawa la ndani.

267
00:13:01,050 --> 00:13:03,490
Hiyo ni nzuri!

268
00:13:03,514 --> 00:13:07,354
Kwa kuwa ni joto, ni hisia nzuri.

269
00:13:07,377 --> 00:13:10,581
Wikiendi ijayo nitaenda bwawani.

270
00:13:10,605 --> 00:13:12,971
Utaenda peke yako?

271
00:13:12,994 --> 00:13:15,733
Nitaenda na dada yangu.

272
00:13:15,757 --> 00:13:19,230
Dada yako pia anapenda kuogelea?

273
00:13:19,254 --> 00:13:25,820
Ndiyo, dada yangu anafundisha kuogelea, ana uwezo mkubwa.

274
00:13:25,843 --> 00:13:28,058
Hii ni nzuri sana!

275
00:13:28,082 --> 00:13:32,701
Baada ya kuogelea, sisi kwa kawaida tunakula chakula kitamu.

276
00:13:32,724 --> 00:13:35,324
Unakula nini?

277
00:13:35,347 --> 00:13:38,313
Tunakula rameni moto.

278
00:13:38,336 --> 00:13:42,342
Kwa kuwa nina njaa, rameni ni tamu sana.

279
00:13:42,366 --> 00:13:46,139
Ndiyo, ninafurahia sana wikiendi.

280
00:13:46,163 --> 00:13:47,663
Sehemu ya 9: Masomo ya Kijapani na Ndoto za Baadaye / Masomo ya Kijapani na Ndoto za Kesho

281
00:13:47,663 --> 00:13:51,429
Unasoma Kijapani vipi?

282
00:13:51,452 --> 00:13:56,252
Kanji ni ngumu sana, kwa hiyo ni vigumu.

283
00:13:56,275 --> 00:13:59,209
Unasoma kila siku?

284
00:13:59,232 --> 00:14:03,867
Ninasoma kwa saa mbili kila siku.

285
00:14:03,890 --> 00:14:06,262
Haya, una bidii sana!

286
00:14:06,285 --> 00:14:11,118
Nataka kufanya kazi katika kampuni ya Kijapani, kwa hiyo nitajitahidi.

287
00:14:11,141 --> 00:14:14,159
Unataka kujiunga na kampuni gani?

288
00:14:14,183 --> 00:14:17,383
Nataka kujiunga na kampuni ya magari.

289
00:14:17,406 --> 00:14:20,372
Unapenda magari ya Kijapani?

290
00:14:20,395 --> 00:14:23,929
Ninapenda sana kwa sababu ni ya kuvutia.

291
00:14:23,952 --> 00:14:28,233
Je, katika siku za usoni utakaa Japani?

292
00:14:28,256 --> 00:14:32,856
Ndiyo. Japani ni salama, kwa hiyo nataka kukaa kwa muda mrefu.

293
00:14:32,879 --> 00:14:35,617
Chakula pia ni kitamu sana!

294
00:14:35,641 --> 00:14:38,974
Napenda sushi na ramen sana.

295
00:14:38,997 --> 00:14:42,164
Siku za mapumziko unafanya nini?

296
00:14:42,187 --> 00:14:45,253
Naangalia anime ya Kijapani.

297
00:14:45,276 --> 00:14:48,510
Je, unafunza Kijapani kupitia anime?

298
00:14:48,533 --> 00:14:52,899
Ni ya furaha, kwa hiyo ni njia nzuri ya kujifunza.

299
00:14:52,922 --> 00:14:56,889
Tutakwenda pamoja kutazama filamu siku hizi?

300
00:14:56,913 --> 00:14:59,208
Ni filamu gani?

301
00:14:59,231 --> 00:15:02,898
Filamu mpya ya anime.

302
00:15:02,921 --> 00:15:04,654
Ninashukuru sana.

303
00:15:04,677 --> 00:15:06,844
Ningependa kwenda sana!

304
00:15:06,867 --> 00:15:11,600
Itafanya mazoezi ya Kijapani, basi tuongee mengi.

305
00:15:11,623 --> 00:15:13,592
Asante.

306
00:15:13,616 --> 00:15:17,849
Kama kuna maneno usiyoyaelewa, uliza.

307
00:15:17,872 --> 00:15:21,872
Nitabeba kamusi, kwa hiyo hakuna matata.

308
00:15:21,895 --> 00:15:23,628
Sawa.

309
00:15:23,651 --> 00:15:25,500
Una bidii sana!

310
00:15:25,523 --> 00:15:30,523
Kuna mtihani wiki ijayo, kwa hiyo nitasoma zaidi.

311
00:15:30,546 --> 00:15:32,746
Nakuunga mkono!

312
00:15:32,769 --> 00:15:35,036
Asante.

313
00:15:35,059 --> 00:15:36,559
Sehemu ya 10: Mpango wa Safari / Kupanga Safari ya Majira ya Joto

314
00:15:36,559 --> 00:15:41,159
Utakwenda safari wakati wa likizo ya joto?

315
00:15:41,182 --> 00:15:44,787
Ndiyo, nataka kwenda safari.

316
00:15:44,810 --> 00:15:47,010
Unataka kwenda wapi?

317
00:15:47,033 --> 00:15:50,768
Nataka kwenda milimani au pwani.

318
00:15:50,792 --> 00:15:53,192
Ni ipi unayopendelea?

319
00:15:53,215 --> 00:15:58,066
Kwa sababu ni joto, napendelea milima yenye baridi.

320
00:15:58,089 --> 00:16:00,023
Sawa sana.

321
00:16:00,046 --> 00:16:02,879
Hokkaido inakuwaje?

322
00:16:02,902 --> 00:16:08,478
Hokkaido iko mbali, kwa hiyo gharama ya ndege ni ghali.

323
00:16:08,501 --> 00:16:11,668
Je, Hakone inakuwaje?

324
00:16:11,691 --> 00:16:14,709
Hakone ni nzuri sana!

325
00:16:14,733 --> 00:16:19,500
Kuna matawani, kwa hiyo unaweza kupumzika vizuri.

326
00:16:19,524 --> 00:16:25,891
Nataka kwenda matawani, basi tutafanya hifadhi katika hoteli ile niliyoiona kwenye mtandao.

327
00:16:25,914 --> 00:16:28,347
Ni hoteli gani?

328
00:16:28,370 --> 00:16:32,587
Hoteli ya zamani iliyoko ndani ya milima.

329
00:16:32,611 --> 00:16:34,944
Je, ni ghali?

330
00:16:34,967 --> 00:16:39,235
Tutafanya hifadhi kwenye mtandao, kwa hiyo ni rahisi.

331
00:16:39,258 --> 00:16:41,692
Hiyo ni nzuri!

332
00:16:41,715 --> 00:16:45,153
Chakula pia kinaonekana kitamu!

333
00:16:45,177 --> 00:16:48,033
Kuna vyakula gani?

334
00:16:48,056 --> 00:16:52,691
Inasemekana kuna vyakula vingi vya samaki.

335
00:16:52,714 --> 00:16:56,997
Napenda samaki, kwa hiyo ninafurahi sana!

336
00:16:57,021 --> 00:16:59,354
Tutakwenda kutoka lini?

337
00:16:59,377 --> 00:17:03,115
Tutakwenda tarehe tano mwezi ujao.

338
00:17:03,138 --> 00:17:05,272
Kwa siku tatu?

339
00:17:05,295 --> 00:17:09,742
Kwa sababu likizo ni fupi, tutakwenda kwa siku mbili tu.

340
00:17:09,765 --> 00:17:12,032
Nimeelewa.

341
00:17:12,055 --> 00:17:15,121
Je, utanunua tiketi za treni pia?

342
00:17:15,144 --> 00:17:18,923
Kwa sababu itakuwa na msongamano, tununue mapema.

343
00:17:18,947 --> 00:17:21,434
Nitainunua leo kwenye stesheni.

344
00:17:21,457 --> 00:17:23,391
Tafadhali.

345
00:17:23,414 --> 00:17:26,682
Natumai sana safari hii.

346
00:17:26,705 --> 00:17:30,197
Mimi pia natumai sana.

347
00:17:30,221 --> 00:17:31,721
Sehemu ya 11: Jinsi ya Kutumia Pasipoti Iliyopotea / Mambo ya Kufanya Pasipoti Ikiwa Imepotea

348
00:17:31,721 --> 00:17:34,121
Umekuwaje?

349
00:17:34,144 --> 00:17:37,436
Sipati pasipoti yangu.

350
00:17:37,459 --> 00:17:40,459
Eeh, kweli?

351
00:17:40,482 --> 00:17:44,731
Ndiyo, haipo ndani ya begi yangu.

352
00:17:44,755 --> 00:17:47,488
Je, umeangalia ndani ya mfuko?

353
00:17:47,511 --> 00:17:50,409
Nimeangalia hata mifukoni.

354
00:17:50,433 --> 00:17:52,713
Lakini haipo.

355
00:17:52,736 --> 00:17:55,474
Umeipoteza wapi?

356
00:17:55,498 --> 00:17:57,746
Sijui.

357
00:17:57,770 --> 00:18:01,003
Leo ulienda wapi?

358
00:18:01,026 --> 00:18:03,793
Nilienda benki.

359
00:18:03,816 --> 00:18:06,902
Baada ya hapo ulienda wapi?

360
00:18:06,926 --> 00:18:10,326
Nilienda dukani kununua vitu.

361
00:18:10,349 --> 00:18:14,515
Je, uliingia choo kwenye duka hilo?

362
00:18:14,538 --> 00:18:17,738
Ndiyo, niliingia chooni.

363
00:18:17,761 --> 00:18:21,328
Labda umeiacha huko.

364
00:18:21,351 --> 00:18:23,484
Ndiyo, kweli.

365
00:18:23,507 --> 00:18:26,907
Je, nipigie simu dukani?

366
00:18:26,930 --> 00:18:29,764
Ndiyo, tafadhali.

367
00:18:29,786 --> 00:18:31,786
Halo?

368
00:18:31,809 --> 00:18:35,696
Kuna pasipoti iliyopotea?

369
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:38,199
Aha, ndivyo.

370
00:18:38,223 --> 00:18:39,990
Sawa.

371
00:18:40,013 --> 00:18:42,086
Imepatikana?

372
00:18:42,109 --> 00:18:44,920
Hapana, hawakupata.

373
00:18:44,944 --> 00:18:47,119
Tumeshindwa.

374
00:18:47,142 --> 00:18:50,309
Nitakwenda nyumbani kesho kutwa.

375
00:18:50,332 --> 00:18:53,108
Hiyo ni tatizo kubwa.

376
00:18:53,131 --> 00:18:55,931
Je, tuende polisi?

377
00:18:55,954 --> 00:18:57,388
Ndiyo, kweli.

378
00:18:57,411 --> 00:18:59,883
Nitakwenda pamoja nawe.

379
00:18:59,906 --> 00:19:01,873
Pole.

380
00:19:01,896 --> 00:19:03,729
Asante.

381
00:19:03,752 --> 00:19:06,919
Aa, ngoja kidogo.

382
00:19:06,942 --> 00:19:09,142
Umekuwaje?

383
00:19:09,165 --> 00:19:13,498
Mfuko wa koti yako unaonekana kujaa kidogo.

384
00:19:13,521 --> 00:19:16,254
Aa, kweli.

385
00:19:16,277 --> 00:19:18,519
Aa, imepatikana!

386
00:19:18,542 --> 00:19:20,309
Hii ndiyo pasipoti.

387
00:19:20,332 --> 00:19:23,827
Ilikuwa ndani ya mfuko wa koti.

388
00:19:23,851 --> 00:19:27,884
Ndiyo, samahani sana.

389
00:19:27,907 --> 00:19:29,684
Sawa sana.

390
00:19:29,708 --> 00:19:31,641
Nimefurahi.

391
00:19:31,664 --> 00:19:33,164
Sehemu ya 12: Mwaliko wa Kwenda Kwenye Izakaya

392
00:19:33,164 --> 00:19:37,807
Una muda Ijumaa hii?

393
00:19:37,831 --> 00:19:41,664
Ijumaa, usiku?

394
00:19:41,687 --> 00:19:45,620
Ndiyo, baada ya kazi.

395
00:19:45,643 --> 00:19:48,477
Kuna nini?

396
00:19:48,500 --> 00:19:53,304
Tutakwenda izakaya mpya pamoja na watu wengine.

397
00:19:53,327 --> 00:19:55,527
Sawa sana.

398
00:19:55,550 --> 00:19:58,124
Tutakwenda pamoja?

399
00:19:58,148 --> 00:20:04,514
Ningependa kwenda, lakini siku ya Ijumaa nina mpango kidogo.

400
00:20:04,537 --> 00:20:08,548
Aa, unafanya kazi za ziada?

401
00:20:08,572 --> 00:20:13,405
Hapana, mama anakuja nyumbani.

402
00:20:13,428 --> 00:20:15,527
Mama yako?

403
00:20:15,551 --> 00:20:20,353
Ndiyo, anatoka vijijini anakuja kutembelea.

404
00:20:20,377 --> 00:20:23,270
Hiyo ni nzuri sana.

405
00:20:23,293 --> 00:20:28,060
Ndiyo, tutakula chakula pamoja.

406
00:20:28,083 --> 00:20:31,887
Basi, siku ya Ijumaa siwezi.

407
00:20:31,911 --> 00:20:35,077
Samahani sana.

408
00:20:35,100 --> 00:20:37,702
Usijali.

409
00:20:37,726 --> 00:20:40,696
Tafadhali nipatie nafasi tena.

410
00:20:40,719 --> 00:20:43,157
Siku ya Jumamosi je?

411
00:20:43,181 --> 00:20:49,181
Jumamosi nitakwenda kununua vitu na mama.

412
00:20:49,204 --> 00:20:51,637
Siku ya Jumapili je?

413
00:20:51,660 --> 00:20:57,393
Jumapili mama atarudi nyumbani, basi nitaweza.

414
00:20:57,416 --> 00:21:02,183
Basi, tutakwenda kutazama filamu siku ya Jumapili?

415
00:21:02,206 --> 00:21:04,648
Filamu?

416
00:21:04,672 --> 00:21:08,441
Kuna filamu nzuri inayoonyeshwa.

417
00:21:08,464 --> 00:21:11,797
Sawa sana, twende.

418
00:21:11,820 --> 00:21:15,688
Basi, tutaenda alasiri ya Jumapili.

419
00:21:15,711 --> 00:21:17,645
Sawa.

420
00:21:17,668 --> 00:21:20,334
Nangojea kwa hamu.

421
00:21:20,357 --> 00:21:24,524
Ufurahie chakula na mama yako.

422
00:21:24,547 --> 00:21:26,837
Asante.

423
00:21:26,861 --> 00:21:28,361
Mstari wa 13: Taarifa ya Kuchelewa / Kutoa Taarifa ya Kuchelewa

424
00:21:28,361 --> 00:21:31,966
Halo, habari za asubuhi.

425
00:21:31,990 --> 00:21:34,356
Habari za asubuhi.

426
00:21:34,379 --> 00:21:36,913
Uko wapi sasa?

427
00:21:36,936 --> 00:21:40,169
Sasa niko kwenye kituo cha treni.

428
00:21:40,192 --> 00:21:43,968
Kazi itaanza hivi punde.

429
00:21:43,991 --> 00:21:48,258
Samahani, nitachelewa kidogo.

430
00:21:48,281 --> 00:21:50,737
Umekuwaje?

431
00:21:50,760 --> 00:21:56,374
Treni imechuchuma, nitachelewa dakika kumi hivi.

432
00:21:56,398 --> 00:21:58,431
Ajali?

433
00:21:58,454 --> 00:22:04,787
Ndio, kulikuwa na ajali kubwa, treni imesimama.

434
00:22:04,810 --> 00:22:08,777
Hiyo ni mbaya sana.

435
00:22:08,800 --> 00:22:12,167
Sasa nitaenda kwa teksi.

436
00:22:12,190 --> 00:22:15,860
Ninafikiri teksi pia zitawa na msongamano.

437
00:22:15,884 --> 00:22:22,051
Kuna watu wengi mbele ya kituo, labda sitapata kupanda.

438
00:22:22,074 --> 00:22:25,013
Nitakwenda kwa miguu kutoka kituoni.

439
00:22:25,036 --> 00:22:28,203
Usijitahidi mno.

440
00:22:28,226 --> 00:22:30,792
Usirudishe.

441
00:22:30,815 --> 00:22:34,187
Ndiyo, nitakuwa makini.

442
00:22:34,211 --> 00:22:37,030
Mkutano unaanza saa ngapi?

443
00:22:37,054 --> 00:22:42,787
Mkutano unaanza saa nne, basi hakuna matatizo.

444
00:22:42,810 --> 00:22:45,044
Sawa sana.

445
00:22:45,067 --> 00:22:46,700
Nimefurahi.

446
00:22:46,723 --> 00:22:49,941
Usiharakishe.

447
00:22:49,965 --> 00:22:53,022
Ninakuomba msamaha sana.

448
00:22:53,045 --> 00:22:57,724
Si kwa sababu ya mtu yeyote, basi usijali.

449
00:22:57,747 --> 00:22:59,480
Asante.

450
00:22:59,503 --> 00:23:03,042
Kuwa makini njiani.

451
00:23:03,066 --> 00:23:06,843
Ndiyo, nitarudi haraka iwezekanavyo.

452
00:23:06,867 --> 00:23:10,300
Ufike ofisini basi uniambie.

453
00:23:10,323 --> 00:23:12,739
Sawa.

454
00:23:12,763 --> 00:23:15,059
Asante sana.

455
00:23:15,083 --> 00:23:18,049
Basi, nitaungojea.

456
00:23:18,072 --> 00:23:20,407
Nitakuaga.

457
00:23:20,431 --> 00:23:21,931
Mstari wa 14: Taarifa ya Ugonjwa / Kutoa Taarifa ya Ugonjwa

458
00:23:21,931 --> 00:23:24,331
Habari zako.

459
00:23:24,354 --> 00:23:26,687
Habari zako.

460
00:23:26,710 --> 00:23:28,677
Umefanya nini?

461
00:23:28,700 --> 00:23:31,507
Sauti yako inasikika tofauti.

462
00:23:31,530 --> 00:23:38,930
Kweli, nina homa ya digrii thelathini na nane, kwa hiyo leo nitapumzika.

463
00:23:38,953 --> 00:23:41,638
Hali yako ni digrii thelathini na nane?

464
00:23:41,662 --> 00:23:44,307
Hiyo ni homa kubwa.

465
00:23:44,331 --> 00:23:50,427
Ndio, pia ninakohoa kidogo na koo langu linauma.

466
00:23:50,450 --> 00:23:53,322
Umekwenda hospitali?

467
00:23:53,346 --> 00:23:56,913
Nitakwenda hospitali sasa hivi.

468
00:23:56,936 --> 00:24:00,903
Kuna hospitali karibu?

469
00:24:00,926 --> 00:24:06,597
Kuna hospitali mpya mbele ya kituo cha treni, nitakwenda huko.

470
00:24:06,620 --> 00:24:09,257
Hiyo ni nzuri.

471
00:24:09,281 --> 00:24:11,779
Unaweza kula chakula?

472
00:24:11,802 --> 00:24:16,889
Sina hamu ya kula, bado sijala chochote.

473
00:24:16,913 --> 00:24:20,479
Ni vizuri ule supu au kitu chochote kinachomimina.

474
00:24:20,502 --> 00:24:24,116
Ndio, nitakunywa kidogo tu.

475
00:24:24,140 --> 00:24:28,673
Kuhusu mkutano wa alasiri, naweza kukukata?

476
00:24:28,696 --> 00:24:30,630
Haina matata.

477
00:24:30,653 --> 00:24:35,859
Mimi nitawasiliana na mteja, usijali.

478
00:24:35,883 --> 00:24:37,816
Asante.

479
00:24:37,839 --> 00:24:40,039
Asante sana.

480
00:24:40,062 --> 00:24:42,835
Ripoti iko wapi?

481
00:24:42,859 --> 00:24:47,862
Iko mezani mwangu, angalia huko.

482
00:24:47,885 --> 00:24:49,852
Sawa.

483
00:24:49,875 --> 00:24:51,521
Nitatafuta.

484
00:24:51,545 --> 00:24:56,545
Samahani kwa usumbufu wote.

485
00:24:56,568 --> 00:25:01,866
Afya yako ni muhimu zaidi, pumzika vizuri.

486
00:25:01,889 --> 00:25:03,541
Asante.

487
00:25:03,564 --> 00:25:08,220
Kunywa dawa na kulala sana, basi.

488
00:25:08,244 --> 00:25:10,537
Ndiyo, nitakufanya hivyo.

489
00:25:10,561 --> 00:25:13,295
Kesho utakuja?

490
00:25:13,319 --> 00:25:18,252
Bado sijui, nitakutumia ujumbe jioni.

491
00:25:18,275 --> 00:25:21,010
Sawa, nitaungoja.

492
00:25:21,034 --> 00:25:23,400
Asante sana.

493
00:25:23,423 --> 00:25:25,623
Pumzika na upone.

494
00:25:25,646 --> 00:25:27,684
Nitakuaga.

495
00:25:27,708 --> 00:25:29,208
Mlo wa mchana leo: Jinsi ya kuchagua pahali pa chakula na mgahawa

496
00:25:29,208 --> 00:25:33,092
Leo tutakula chakula cha mchana wapi?

497
00:25:33,115 --> 00:25:35,048
Ndiyo, kweli.

498
00:25:35,071 --> 00:25:37,238
Unapendelea wapi?

499
00:25:37,261 --> 00:25:40,428
Je, mgahawa wetu wa kawaida ni mzuri?

500
00:25:40,451 --> 00:25:46,017
Huko ni tamu, lakini ni mbali kidogo.

501
00:25:46,040 --> 00:25:48,810
Ndiyo, tutaenda kwa miguu.

502
00:25:48,833 --> 00:25:53,834
Leo kuna mvua, ni vizuri tukae karibu.

503
00:25:53,857 --> 00:25:57,943
Je, mgahawa wa Kiitaliano mbele ya kituo cha treni ni mzuri?

504
00:25:57,967 --> 00:26:01,051
Mgahawa wa Kiitaliano ni mzuri.

505
00:26:01,075 --> 00:26:06,108
Ni karibu na kituo cha treni, na chakula ni tamu, basi tukae huko.

506
00:26:06,131 --> 00:26:10,767
Lakini huko kuna watu wengi kila wakati.

507
00:26:10,790 --> 00:26:16,324
Bado ni saa tano na nusu, nafikiri tutafika salama.

508
00:26:16,347 --> 00:26:17,963
Ndiyo, kweli.

509
00:26:17,986 --> 00:26:20,319
Twende mapema.

510
00:26:20,342 --> 00:26:23,109
Unapenda nini kwenye menyu?

511
00:26:23,132 --> 00:26:26,399
Mimi napenda pizza.

512
00:26:26,423 --> 00:26:29,597
Mimi daima nakula pasta.

513
00:26:29,620 --> 00:26:36,820
Huko pizza ni kubwa na jibini nyingi, ni tamu sana.

514
00:26:36,843 --> 00:26:39,118
Kuna keki pia.

515
00:26:39,141 --> 00:26:41,718
Je, tutakula kitindamlo?

516
00:26:41,741 --> 00:26:47,419
Tutakuwa na kazi nyingi alasiri, basi tuile vitu tamu.

517
00:26:47,443 --> 00:26:49,176
Sawa sana.

518
00:26:49,199 --> 00:26:51,271
Nakubali.

519
00:26:51,294 --> 00:26:53,061
Je, tutahifadhi nafasi?

520
00:26:53,085 --> 00:26:56,286
Unajua nambari ya simu?

521
00:26:56,309 --> 00:26:59,776
Ndio, nimeipata kwenye mtandao.

522
00:26:59,799 --> 00:27:02,011
Sawa, basi tafadhali.

523
00:27:02,034 --> 00:27:07,168
Aa, nilitazama mtandao, leo wanapumzika.

524
00:27:07,191 --> 00:27:10,557
Eeh, ni mbaya sana.

525
00:27:10,580 --> 00:27:12,955
Tutafanyeje?

526
00:27:12,978 --> 00:27:16,312
Je, duka la udon karibu na ofisi ni nzuri?

527
00:27:16,335 --> 00:27:18,368
Sawa sana.

528
00:27:18,391 --> 00:27:23,438
Huko ni rahisi, bei nafuu, na huduma ni haraka.

529
00:27:23,462 --> 00:27:26,131
Udon pia ni tamu sana.

530
00:27:26,154 --> 00:27:29,587
Basi, leo tutakula udon.

531
00:27:29,610 --> 00:27:31,988
Ndiyo, twende.

532
00:27:32,012 --> 00:27:33,512
Mstari 16: Mfanyakazi Mpya wa Kujitolea / The New Part-Time Employee

533
00:27:33,512 --> 00:27:37,205
Mfanyakazi mpya wa kujitolea anaendelea aje?

534
00:27:37,228 --> 00:27:39,432
Ni Bwana Tanaka.

535
00:27:39,456 --> 00:27:41,691
Anafaa sana.

536
00:27:41,714 --> 00:27:43,408
Kweli?

537
00:27:43,431 --> 00:27:45,598
Ana tabia gani?

538
00:27:45,621 --> 00:27:51,021
Ana bidii, ni mpole, na ni mtu wa ajabu.

539
00:27:51,044 --> 00:27:53,419
Hiyo ni nzuri.

540
00:27:53,443 --> 00:27:55,676
Kazi yake inakuwaje?

541
00:27:55,699 --> 00:28:01,667
Hufanya kazi haraka, kwa uangalifu, na kweli anatusaidia sana.

542
00:28:01,691 --> 00:28:03,744
Haya, una bidii sana!

543
00:28:03,768 --> 00:28:05,901
Ana umri mdogo?

544
00:28:05,924 --> 00:28:07,357
Ndiyo.

545
00:28:07,380 --> 00:28:09,782
Mwaka huu ana miaka ishirini.

546
00:28:09,806 --> 00:28:11,973
Ana umri mdogo sana.

547
00:28:11,996 --> 00:28:14,162
Je, ni mwanafunzi?

548
00:28:14,185 --> 00:28:15,919
Ndiyo.

549
00:28:15,941 --> 00:28:19,561
Anasoma Kiingereza chuo kikuu.

550
00:28:19,585 --> 00:28:22,070
Anaweza kuzungumza Kiingereza?

551
00:28:22,093 --> 00:28:23,584
Ndiyo.

552
00:28:23,607 --> 00:28:30,261
Anaweza kuzungumza Kiingereza, pia anaelewa Kichina kidogo, ni mwerevu sana.

553
00:28:30,284 --> 00:28:34,964
Wateja wa kigeni wanapotembelea, atatusaidia sana.

554
00:28:34,988 --> 00:28:36,465
Ndiyo.

555
00:28:36,488 --> 00:28:40,171
Jana alikuwa akizungumza na mteja mwingereza.

556
00:28:40,195 --> 00:28:44,804
Bwana Tanaka tayari ni maarufu katika duka?

557
00:28:44,827 --> 00:28:46,261
Ndiyo.

558
00:28:46,284 --> 00:28:52,520
Ana furaha, hupendeza, na ninadhani anapendwa na wote.

559
00:28:52,543 --> 00:28:56,755
Ninataka kumpata Bwana Tanaka mapema.

560
00:28:56,779 --> 00:29:01,114
Kesho mchana, Bwana Tanaka atakuwa kazini.

561
00:29:01,137 --> 00:29:03,204
Sawa.

562
00:29:03,227 --> 00:29:06,427
Mimi kesho nitakuwa na likizo.

563
00:29:06,450 --> 00:29:09,216
Hiyo ni ya kusikitisha.

564
00:29:09,239 --> 00:29:13,239
Je, kesho kutwa Bwana Tanaka atakuwepo?

565
00:29:13,262 --> 00:29:14,699
Ndiyo.

566
00:29:14,722 --> 00:29:17,756
Kesho kutwa pia atakuwepo asubuhi.

567
00:29:17,779 --> 00:29:19,836
Sawa sana.

568
00:29:19,859 --> 00:29:22,026
Kesho kutwa nitamusalimia.

569
00:29:22,049 --> 00:29:25,533
Tukale chakula cha mchana pamoja.

570
00:29:25,557 --> 00:29:27,362
Sawa sana.

571
00:29:27,386 --> 00:29:31,386
Bwana Tanaka anapenda chakula gani?

572
00:29:31,409 --> 00:29:34,576
Alisema anapenda nyama.

573
00:29:34,599 --> 00:29:39,565
Basi, twende mgahawa wa hambaaga karibu na kituo cha treni.

574
00:29:39,588 --> 00:29:44,155
Huko ni tamu, bei nafuu, na ni nzuri.

575
00:29:44,178 --> 00:29:45,864
Ndiyo.

576
00:29:45,887 --> 00:29:48,620
Nadhani Bwana Tanaka atafurahi.

577
00:29:48,643 --> 00:29:50,920
Ninangojea kwa hamu.

578
00:29:50,944 --> 00:29:52,432
Ndiyo.

579
00:29:52,456 --> 00:29:55,323
Ninataka kufanya kazi pamoja naye mapema.

580
00:29:55,346 --> 00:30:00,122
Kuanzia sasa tutakuwa na kazi nyingi, basi tujitahidi.

581
00:30:00,145 --> 00:30:01,645
Mstari 17: Ukarabati wa Nyumba Yangu Mpya / Introducing My New Apartment

582
00:30:01,645 --> 00:30:05,612
Umeamua chumba kipi?

583
00:30:05,634 --> 00:30:08,634
Ndiyo, hatimaye nimeamua.

584
00:30:08,657 --> 00:30:10,751
Ni chumba cha aina gani?

585
00:30:10,775 --> 00:30:16,342
Ni karibu na kituo cha treni, ni mpya, na ni chumba nzuri sana.

586
00:30:16,365 --> 00:30:19,458
Karibu na kituo cha treni ni rahisi sana.

587
00:30:19,482 --> 00:30:22,815
Ndiyo, ni dakika tano kwa miguu.

588
00:30:22,838 --> 00:30:25,926
Kuna duka lolote karibu?

589
00:30:25,949 --> 00:30:31,916
Kuna supamaketi karibu na konbini pia, ni rahisi kununua vitu.

590
00:30:31,939 --> 00:30:34,472
Hiyo ni nzuri sana!

591
00:30:34,495 --> 00:30:37,862
Ndiyo, nafurahi sana.

592
00:30:37,885 --> 00:30:40,518
Je, chumba ni kubwa?

593
00:30:40,541 --> 00:30:43,112
Ni wastani kwa ukubwa.

594
00:30:43,135 --> 00:30:45,269
Je, kodi ni ghali?

595
00:30:45,292 --> 00:30:52,258
Hapana, kodi ni rahisi na hata intaneti ni bure, ni faida sana.

596
00:30:52,281 --> 00:30:54,340
Hii ni nzuri sana!

597
00:30:54,363 --> 00:30:56,617
Iko wapi?

598
00:30:56,641 --> 00:30:59,241
Iko karibu na Shinjuku.

599
00:30:59,264 --> 00:31:01,864
Ni karibu na ofisi yangu pia.

600
00:31:01,887 --> 00:31:05,304
Ndiyo, kwa treni ni dakika kumi tu.

601
00:31:05,328 --> 00:31:07,728
Utahamia lini?

602
00:31:07,751 --> 00:31:11,237
Nitahamia Jumapili ya kwanza ya mwezi ujao.

603
00:31:11,260 --> 00:31:13,627
Je, mizigo yako ni mingi?

604
00:31:13,650 --> 00:31:19,823
Hapana, hata kitanda sina wala televisheni, ni kidogo tu.

605
00:31:19,847 --> 00:31:22,503
Je, utanunua samani mpya?

606
00:31:22,526 --> 00:31:27,093
Ndiyo, nina mpango wa kununua mwishoni mwa wiki hii.

607
00:31:27,116 --> 00:31:29,051
Naomba nikusaidie?

608
00:31:29,074 --> 00:31:30,885
Asante.

609
00:31:30,908 --> 00:31:33,401
Asante, lakini niko sawa.

610
00:31:33,425 --> 00:31:38,863
Sawa. Baada ya kuhamia, naweza kukujulia?

611
00:31:38,886 --> 00:31:40,919
Ndiyo, karibu sana.

612
00:31:40,942 --> 00:31:42,790
Tafadhali njoo.

613
00:31:42,814 --> 00:31:45,297
Nitapika chakula.

614
00:31:45,320 --> 00:31:47,320
Ninashukuru sana.

615
00:31:47,343 --> 00:31:49,147
Tupige party!

616
00:31:49,171 --> 00:31:50,937
Sawa sana.

617
00:31:50,960 --> 00:31:53,960
Nitakuletea divai tamu.

618
00:31:53,983 --> 00:31:56,550
Nangojea kwa hamu.

619
00:31:56,573 --> 00:31:58,073
Mkutano wa Baadaye: Mabadiliko ya Mkutano kutokana na Dhoruba

620
00:31:58,073 --> 00:32:02,640
Nina jambo la kuzungumza kuhusu mkutano wa kesho.

621
00:32:02,663 --> 00:32:05,556
Ndiyo, nini kinaendelea?

622
00:32:05,579 --> 00:32:11,832
Kesho kuna dhoruba, basi treni zinaweza kusimama.

623
00:32:11,855 --> 00:32:14,347
Nimeona habari.

624
00:32:14,371 --> 00:32:17,588
Dhoruba kubwa inakaribia, kwa kweli.

625
00:32:17,612 --> 00:32:21,679
Ndiyo, inasemekana ni hatari sana.

626
00:32:21,702 --> 00:32:24,991
Kuja ofisini kutakuwa vigumu.

627
00:32:25,014 --> 00:32:30,687
Kwa hiyo, je, tugeuze mkutano wa kesho kuwa mtandaoni?

628
00:32:30,711 --> 00:32:33,278
Mtandaoni, basi?

629
00:32:33,300 --> 00:32:35,434
Nadhani ni wazo zuri.

630
00:32:35,457 --> 00:32:40,460
Kila mtu atashiriki kutoka nyumbani, hivyo ni salama.

631
00:32:40,483 --> 00:32:42,129
Ndiyo, kweli.

632
00:32:42,152 --> 00:32:45,085
Hatuwezi kujikosesha.

633
00:32:45,108 --> 00:32:46,842
Asante.

634
00:32:46,865 --> 00:32:50,721
Mkutano utaanza saa nane mchana, ndiyo?

635
00:32:50,744 --> 00:32:54,358
Ndiyo, saa zitaendelea kama zilivyopangwa.

636
00:32:54,381 --> 00:32:56,114
Sawa.

637
00:32:56,137 --> 00:32:58,871
Je, hati zetu?

638
00:32:58,894 --> 00:33:03,331
Nitakutumia hati kwa barua pepe jioni leo.

639
00:33:03,354 --> 00:33:07,688
Nitazisoma kabla ya mkutano, asante.

640
00:33:07,711 --> 00:33:11,677
Je, ni vizuri kuwataarifu mkuu wa idara?

641
00:33:11,700 --> 00:33:17,519
Ndiyo, nitamwambia mkuu wa idara, usijali.

642
00:33:17,543 --> 00:33:19,143
Asante.

643
00:33:19,166 --> 00:33:20,844
Asante sana.

644
00:33:20,867 --> 00:33:25,001
Je, kulikuwa na mipango na mteja?

645
00:33:25,024 --> 00:33:29,957
Ndiyo, kulikuwa na mipango asubuhi kesho.

646
00:33:29,980 --> 00:33:32,313
Umeghairi?

647
00:33:32,336 --> 00:33:38,070
Ndiyo, kwa sababu mvua ni kubwa, tumebadilisha kwa wiki ijayo.

648
00:33:38,093 --> 00:33:40,359
Ilikuwa nzuri sana.

649
00:33:40,382 --> 00:33:45,077
Kesho nitakua nikifanya kazi nyumbani kwa siku nzima.

650
00:33:45,101 --> 00:33:47,916
Unaelekea kuibeba kompyuta yako nyumbani?

651
00:33:47,939 --> 00:33:53,232
Ndiyo, ni nzito lakini ni lazima niibebe kwa sababu ninahitaji.

652
00:33:53,256 --> 00:33:55,722
Ingia salama nyumbani.

653
00:33:55,745 --> 00:33:59,920
Ndiyo, nitarudi kabla ya upepo kuwa mkali.

654
00:33:59,944 --> 00:34:03,517
Leo tutaacha kazi mapema.

655
00:34:03,541 --> 00:34:05,589
Ndiyo, asante sana.

656
00:34:05,612 --> 00:34:08,021
Habari zako.

657
00:34:08,045 --> 00:34:09,545
Sehemu ya 19: Matatizo ya Kompyuta na Jinsi ya Kukabiliana Nayo

658
00:34:09,545 --> 00:34:11,778
Habari za asubuhi.

659
00:34:11,801 --> 00:34:14,134
Habari za asubuhi.

660
00:34:14,157 --> 00:34:16,490
Umekuwaje?

661
00:34:16,513 --> 00:34:18,513
Pole.

662
00:34:18,536 --> 00:34:22,210
Kompyuta yangu imeharibika.

663
00:34:22,234 --> 00:34:23,967
Eh?

664
00:34:23,990 --> 00:34:25,857
Kweli?

665
00:34:25,881 --> 00:34:27,647
Ndiyo.

666
00:34:27,670 --> 00:34:31,670
Tangu asubuhi skrini imekuwa nyeusi kabisa.

667
00:34:31,693 --> 00:34:34,627
Hiyo ni mbaya sana.

668
00:34:34,650 --> 00:34:37,583
Umeme unaingia?

669
00:34:37,606 --> 00:34:42,614
Umeme unaingia, lakini sipati chochote kuona.

670
00:34:42,637 --> 00:34:45,074
Tumeshindwa sasa.

671
00:34:45,098 --> 00:34:50,101
Je, utashughulikia maandishi ya presentation ya leo?

672
00:34:50,124 --> 00:34:55,991
Yako ndani ya kompyuta hiyo, kwa hiyo sitaweza kuyatoa mara moja.

673
00:34:56,014 --> 00:34:59,347
Hukusave kwenye USB?

674
00:34:59,370 --> 00:35:04,854
Kwa kawaida nasave, lakini jana niliisahau.

675
00:35:04,878 --> 00:35:07,316
Sawa.

676
00:35:07,339 --> 00:35:10,942
Mkutano ni mchana wa leo, sivyo?

677
00:35:10,966 --> 00:35:12,647
Ndiyo.

678
00:35:12,671 --> 00:35:15,471
Ninakuomba msamaha sana.

679
00:35:15,493 --> 00:35:19,900
Bado kuna muda, hakuna matata.

680
00:35:19,924 --> 00:35:21,591
Asante.

681
00:35:21,614 --> 00:35:25,792
Je, ungependa kutumia kompyuta yangu ya zamani?

682
00:35:25,815 --> 00:35:27,068
Ndiyo.

683
00:35:27,092 --> 00:35:29,325
Unaweza kunikopesha?

684
00:35:29,348 --> 00:35:31,548
Ndiyo, hakuna shida.

685
00:35:31,571 --> 00:35:33,847
Nitakuleta mara moja.

686
00:35:33,870 --> 00:35:35,504
Tafadhali.

687
00:35:35,527 --> 00:35:40,060
Nitayarejesha maandishi kwa haraka.

688
00:35:40,083 --> 00:35:43,849
Nitakusaidia, tutafanya pamoja.

689
00:35:43,872 --> 00:35:46,476
Asante sana kweli.

690
00:35:46,500 --> 00:35:50,467
Je, utapeleka kompyuta iliyoharibika kwa ajili ya kutengeneza?

691
00:35:50,490 --> 00:35:52,023
Ndiyo.

692
00:35:52,046 --> 00:35:56,328
Nitawapa watu wa IT wa kampuni yetu ili watazame.

693
00:35:56,352 --> 00:35:59,318
Ni bora ufanye hivyo.

694
00:35:59,341 --> 00:36:02,948
Natumai data hazitapotea.

695
00:36:02,972 --> 00:36:07,505
Kuna data muhimu sana, naomba zisipotee.

696
00:36:07,528 --> 00:36:09,097
Ndiyo.

697
00:36:09,121 --> 00:36:12,654
Kwa siku zijazo nitahakikisha ninasave vizuri.

698
00:36:12,677 --> 00:36:17,334
Kila mtu anaweza kukosea, usijali sana.

699
00:36:17,358 --> 00:36:20,491
Asante kwa kuonyesha wema.

700
00:36:20,514 --> 00:36:24,781
Sasa, haraka tuyarejeshe maandishi.

701
00:36:24,804 --> 00:36:26,175
Ndiyo.

702
00:36:26,198 --> 00:36:28,053
Nitapigania.

703
00:36:28,076 --> 00:36:29,576
Sehemu ya 20: Furaha ya Wikiendi / Furaha ya Wikiendi Kwenye Bustani ya Burudani

704
00:36:29,576 --> 00:36:34,344
Je, wikiendi uliwahi kufanya jambo lolote la furaha?

705
00:36:34,368 --> 00:36:38,539
Ndiyo, nilienda bustani ya burudani na marafiki.

706
00:36:38,563 --> 00:36:40,445
Sawa sana.

707
00:36:40,468 --> 00:36:43,072
Hali ya hewa ilikuwa nzuri, sivyo?

708
00:36:43,096 --> 00:36:49,179
Ndiyo, ilikuwa joto na hakukuwa na upepo, ilikuwa nzuri kabisa.

709
00:36:49,202 --> 00:36:52,135
Ulienda kwenye roller coaster?

710
00:36:52,158 --> 00:36:53,635
Ndiyo.

711
00:36:53,659 --> 00:36:58,192
Ni ya kutisha lakini ni ya kufurahisha, kwa hiyo nilienda mara tatu.

712
00:36:58,215 --> 00:37:00,382
Mara tatu?

713
00:37:00,405 --> 00:37:02,405
Haya, una bidii sana!

714
00:37:02,428 --> 00:37:07,713
Rafiki yangu anapenda roller coaster, kwa hiyo tulikwenda pamoja.

715
00:37:07,736 --> 00:37:10,302
Watu walikuwepo wengi?

716
00:37:10,325 --> 00:37:11,892
Ndiyo.

