00:37:11,915 --> 00:37:17,248
Je, utashughulikia maandishi ya presentation ya leo?

718
00:37:17,271 --> 00:37:19,328
Yako ndani ya kompyuta hiyo, kwa hiyo sitaweza kuyatoa mara moja.

719
00:37:19,352 --> 00:37:23,560
Tulitembea sana kwa hiyo miguu yangu inaniuma.

720
00:37:23,583 --> 00:37:25,816
Pole kwa uchovu.

721
00:37:25,839 --> 00:37:29,406
Nimekuwa nyumbani kwa muda mrefu.

722
00:37:29,429 --> 00:37:32,286
Mkutano ni mchana wa leo, sivyo?

723
00:37:32,310 --> 00:37:38,077
Nilitaka kusafisha na pia kusoma kitabu, kwa hiyo sikufanya nje.

724
00:37:38,100 --> 00:37:41,233
Umepumzika vizuri?

725
00:37:41,256 --> 00:37:44,667
Nimekulala vizuri, kwa hiyo leo nina nguvu.

726
00:37:44,690 --> 00:37:46,664
Hiyo ni nzuri.

727
00:37:46,687 --> 00:37:49,354
Umesoma kitabu gani?

728
00:37:49,377 --> 00:37:52,177
Kitabu cha historia ya Japani.

729
00:37:52,200 --> 00:37:54,433
Si vigumu?

730
00:37:54,456 --> 00:38:00,105
Kuna kanji nyingi kidogo zinazofanya iwe vigumu, lakini ni ya kuvutia.

731
00:38:00,129 --> 00:38:02,462
Inanifundisha mengi.

732
00:38:02,485 --> 00:38:03,704
Ndiyo.

733
00:38:03,728 --> 00:38:08,166
Nataka kuwa bora zaidi katika Kijapani, kwa hiyo nitajitahidi.

734
00:38:08,189 --> 00:38:10,209
Hii ni nzuri sana!

735
00:38:10,232 --> 00:38:15,043
Je, tutaenda pamoja kwenye makumbusho ya sanaa wakati wa likizo ijayo?

736
00:38:15,067 --> 00:38:17,340
Makumbusho ya sanaa?

737
00:38:17,363 --> 00:38:21,630
Kuna picha mashuhura zinazofika, na nataka kuziangalia.

738
00:38:21,653 --> 00:38:23,268
Sawa sana.

739
00:38:23,292 --> 00:38:27,625
Mimi pia napenda kuangalia picha, kwa hiyo nataka kwenda.

740
00:38:27,648 --> 00:38:30,815
Je, Jumapili inafaa?

741
00:38:30,838 --> 00:38:33,977
Ni makumbusho karibu na kituo cha treni, ndio?

742
00:38:34,000 --> 00:38:35,467
Ndiyo.

743
00:38:35,490 --> 00:38:39,823
Ni karibu, na ni safi, ni mahali pazuri sana.

744
00:38:39,846 --> 00:38:42,257
Nangojea kwa hamu.